  "description": "That thorn in my side, my elder brother Yunjun. He's already such a nuisance, and now he's summoning a male courtesan behind my back!\n\nYunhyung simply couldn't let his elder brother Yunjun get away with this. He resolved to give him such a thorough thrashing he wouldn't know which way was up.\n\n\"I never imagined my elder brother would be a sodomite.\"\n\"Brother, this is... Ugh!\"\n\"Does that woman know too? That you, a man of honour, call in some bloke for such debauchery?\"\n\nYun-jun’s flushed, dishevelled form was revealed,\nand Yun-hyeong, excited by his elder brother’s unusual appearance, licked his dry lips with his tongue.\n\n“Whether you’re sodomising or secretly selling your backside, I don’t care. But.”\n“…….”\n“You must sell it to me too.”\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286012237), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lesson4_lewd_bro), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lessons_for_vulgar_brother), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000076806)",
